<title>USA: Salem, Ore., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Salem, Ore., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $18.540 million of Salem, Ore., water and sewer revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.3770 percent.</p>
</text>
